  "dcterms:description": "A BioBricks repository named 'public-biobricks-agent' ('Public Biobricks Chat AI'). It is NOT a data brick: the on-disk repository contains only a README.md (an ASCII banner plus a Markdown table cataloguing other biobricks-ai bricks and their upstream GitHub links) with no dvc.yaml, no stages/, no download/ or brick/ data outputs, no .bb/source.jsonld, and no LICENSE file. It functions as an index/agent pointing at other bricks (Chemprop, CTD, STRING, ChEMBL, PubChem, PubMed, etc.) rather than packaging any redistributable dataset of its own.",
