  "biobricks:reviewNotes": "Determined by the annotation agent (Claude, slice items[1350:1356]). This repository is not a redistributable dataset; it is a catalog/agent index whose only tracked content is a README.md listing other biobricks-ai bricks. There is no LICENSE file, no upstream data download, and no license statement anywhere in the repo, so both the license and any redistribution right are UNSTATED and classed unknown. Commercial use is marked prohibited conservatively because no redistribution right is granted. HUMAN REVIEW REQUIRED: decide whether this repo should even carry a data-source manifest (it packages no data); if it is meant to be published, the biobricks-ai org should add an explicit code/content license. The individual bricks it references each carry their own separate licenses.",
